sequenceDiagram
participant C as Central Vault
participant A as AWX
participant Cam as KV-bridge
participant T as Antenna-VM
participant Ant as Antenna Vault

Note over C,Ant: Bootstrap
C->>A: bootstrap token
A->>Ant: relay bootstrap token
A->>Cam: relay bootstrap token
A->>T: relay bootstrap token

Note over Cam,Ant: Step 1: get secret and antenna address
Cam->>C: get new secret + antenna address
C-->>Cam: secret + antenna address

Note over Cam,Ant: Step 2: push
Cam->>Ant: push new secret

Note over Cam,Ant: Step 3: get local tokens
Cam->>Ant: get token
Ant-->>Cam: token
T->>Ant: get token
Ant-->>T: token

Note over Cam,Ant: Step 4: read secrets
Cam->>Ant: read secret
Ant-->>Cam: secret
T->>Ant: read secret
Ant-->>T: secret
